    <string name="style_logo_desc">The logo (or the title) over the backdrop, nothing else</string>
    <string name="style_backdrop_desc">Just the image</string>
    <string name="style_hidden">Hidden with the %1$s style</string>
    <string name="details_description">How each wallpaper looks: style (everything, the logo alone or just the image), language, synopsis length, cast, what the footer shows (the list it came from, the streaming services) and image resolution. A shorter synopsis keeps the text clear of the launcher rows. Header chooses what the line under the title shows: ratings, year, runtime, genres. Language of each part puts the logo or the synopsis in another language.</string>

